covered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=515023326998\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=515023326998\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker52","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=515023326404\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=515023326404\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker53","name":"Abrisham Monster","legend":"Rumors say a relic monster of 7 ft long inhabits Abrisham Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Pohomao Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 17 ft long inhabits Pohomao Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Wanchap Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 5 ft long inhabits Wanchap Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Jiyah Monster","legend":"Tales say a relic monster of 13 ft long inhabits Jiyah Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Suzhou Monster","legend":"Rumors say a relic monster of 9 ft long inhabits Suzhou Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Hengzhou Monster","legend":"Elders say a relic monster of 16 ft long inhabits Hengzhou Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Assaousa Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 16 ft long inhabits Assaousa Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Hasaling Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 28 ft long."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Treroelis Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 ft long."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Horster Vampire","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a golden Vampire who inhabits Horster hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Hamaq Vampire","legend":"Tipplers speak of a big Vampire who inhabits Hamaq hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Srinahal Troll","legend":"Rumors speak of a superior Troll who inhabits Srinahal hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Stotfordbu Undead","legend":"Rumors speak of a proud Undead who inhabits Stotfordbu hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Iderkakel Vampire","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a magical Vampire who inhabits Iderkakel hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Tanan Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Geocheonism."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Alemerkay Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Buyvargism."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Phu Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Old Vietic Spirits."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Burenet Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Ulus Beliefs."},{"id":"marker71","name":"Agrig Owls","legend":"A gang of highlander bandits."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Yarim Apes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Weiwan Rooks","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Mino Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc32\udc2d\udc20\ud802\ud802𐠢\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc10\udc2d\udc23\ud802𐠃\udc15\udc16\udc05\udc33\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅\ud802 \udc0c𐠑\ud802\ud802𐠃 \ud802𐠱𐠸 \udc13\udc1f\ud802𐠞 \udc0f𐠳 \udc29\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙𐠣𐠔𐠼\ud802𐠿𐠯𐠨𐠔\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker78","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Shekmun Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Lai Tho Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of cunning in Lai Tho, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Arzazer Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Arzazer, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Eagles migration","legend":"A huge group of eagles are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Cranes migration","legend":"A huge group of cranes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Tarbotham Sinkhole","legend":"The Tarbotham Sinkhole. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Kahile Cave","legend":"The Kahile Cave. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Asfrah Cavern","legend":"The Asfrah Cavern. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Pulalu Necropolis","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Washarsip Tomb","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/806\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker93","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2474\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker94","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1221\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker95","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3053\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker96","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3459\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"}]
